// 官報の発行に関する法律（令和五年法律第八十五号）— the Act on the Issuance of
// the Official Gazette, in force from the day fixed by 政令 (附則第一条).
//
// This is the набор 1 "provision of law" package for Japan (stage C). Its
// mechanism is the closest to Germany's and the Netherlands': promulgation is
// CONSTITUTED by the gazette issue, not proved or presumed —
//
// (a) officiality: 公布 of laws, orders and treaties is made BY 官報 (art. 3);
//     官報 is issued by putting the electronic record at the public's disposal
//     through automatic public transmission (art. 5(2)); the promulgation takes
//     place AT THE TIME that measure is taken (art. 6). If disaster makes that
//     impossible, a paper 書面官報 posted at the Cabinet Office board issues the
//     gazette, and promulgation takes place at the time of posting (art. 11).
//     An electronic record copied from the gazette record under art. 5(5) or
//     art. 10 counts as 官報 for other laws' provisions on supplying or
//     sending the gazette (art. 12);
// (b) commencement: the Act does not set the commencement day of promulgated
//     laws. Its own application is by issue: the Act applies to 官報 issued on
//     or after its enforcement day, and does not affect the legal position of
//     官報 issued before (附則第二条・第三条). The day itself is delegated to
//     政令 (附則第一条) — 令和六年政令第三百九号 fixes 2025-04-01, and
//     20-application.law derives the day from it;
// (c) precedence of a consolidation over the original: the Act is silent.
//     A legislation database copy (e-Gov) is not made 官報 by art. 12 —
//     declared boundary, not a rule.
//
// Witness: `jp.constitution` pins the Constitution from the e-Gov
// API (PINNED_UNOFFICIAL_COPY); tests/08 asks whether that copy is 官報.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package jp.kanpo version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:jp:corpus:clir:kanpo";

// --- Entities --------------------------------------------------------------

entity KanpoIssue { label ja official "官報（発行される各号）"; }
entity PromulgationMatter { label ja official "公布等事項（法令、条約、詔書、告示など第三条の対象）"; }
entity CopiedRecord { label ja official "電磁的官報記録に係る情報を複写した電磁的記録その他の複写"; }
